# Scope baseline — a point-in-time snapshot of every account balance and the
# organisation's net position. Never commit: the deploy flow makes this repo
# public, and it is a migration-window artifact, not source. Regenerate with
# `npm run snapshot:capture` at the start of a window.
scripts/scope-baseline.json
